{
  "zh-CN": {
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_NAME": "Banshee",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_DESCRIPTION": "Banshee是一位空中幸存者，擅长在近距离战斗中穿梭。<color=#CCD3E0>\n\n< ! > ATK伞挥动较慢，但非常适合升空。没有追踪敌人时，悬停期间也可以挥动它。\n\n< ! > 在施放俯冲轰炸前积攒充能次数，可在最佳打击点造成毁灭性伤害。\n\n< ! > HDN推进器可大幅提升Banshee的空中机动性——谨慎使用以躲避致命的敌方弹幕。\n\n< ! > CAL手雷擅长聚拢敌人——尝试将俯冲轰炸瞄准其中心以获得最大效率！\n\n</color>",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_SUBTITLE": "彼岸之屋的预兆者",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_LORE": "随着工具化为武器，彼岸之屋严格等级制度中的新势力崛起，以“实验”他们新获得的技术。在这些势力中，Banshee凭借FLT伞在空战武器中占据主导地位。凭借召唤幽火和坍缩重力的能力，其破坏力无穷无尽。在未来，彼岸之屋希望将设计完善至超越日月之境。",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_OUTRO_FLAVOR": "..于是她离去了，她的低语在永恒中回响。",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_OUTRO_FAILURE": "..于是她消失了，回荡着震耳欲聋的寂静。",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_PASSIVE_NAME": "FLT伞",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_PASSIVE_DESCRIPTION": "按住跳跃键使Banshee在空中悬停。悬停时，你的<style=cIsUtility>主要技能</style>会转化为施加<color=#ba8fff>预兆</color>的定向攻击。",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_PRIMARY_ATKUMBRELLA_NAME": "ATK伞",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_PRIMARY_ATKUMBRELLA_DESCRIPTION": "<color=#ba8fff>预兆</color>。向前挥砍，造成<style=cIsDamage>250%伤害</style>。每第3次挥砍将你向前推进并升空，造成<style=cIsDamage>300%伤害</style>。",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_PRIMARY_THRSTUMBRELLA_NAME": "THRST伞",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_PRIMARY_THRSTUMBRELLA_DESCRIPTION": "<color=#ba8fff>预兆</color>。向前挥砍，造成<style=cIsDamage>250%伤害</style>。每第3次挥砍将你推向空中，造成<style=cIsDamage>300%伤害</style>。",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_PRIMARY_WISP_NAME": "以太幽火",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_PRIMARY_WISP_DESCRIPTION": "发射一团幽火，造成<style=cIsDamage>200%伤害</style>。",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_SECONDARY_DIVE_NAME": "俯冲轰炸",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_SECONDARY_DIVE_DESCRIPTION": "<style=cIsUtility>空气动力</style>。向下俯冲，撞击时造成<style=cIsDamage>250%伤害</style>。<style=cIsHealth>消耗</style>所有<style=cIsUtility>技能</style>充能，每消耗一次便提高<style=cIsDamage>造成的伤害</style>。",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_UTILITY_THRUST_NAME": "HDN推进器",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_UTILITY_THRUST_DESCRIPTION": "<color=#ba8fff>预兆</color>。向一个方向冲刺。",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_UTILITY_SUPERTHRUST_NAME": "EXP推进器",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_UTILITY_SUPERTHRUST_DESCRIPTION": "<color=#ba8fff>预兆</color>。向一个方向冲刺。<color=#ba8fff>预兆</color>额外激活<style=cIsUtility>4</style>次。",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_SPECIAL_CALAMITAS_NAME": "CAL手雷",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_SPECIAL_CALAMITAS_DESCRIPTION": "投掷一枚产生不稳定黑洞的手雷。<style=cIsUtility>2</style>秒后，黑洞坍缩，造成<style=cIsDamage>700%伤害</style>。",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_SPECIAL_SCEP_CALAMITAS_NAME": "Calamitas",
    "KENKO_BANSHEE_SPECIAL_SCEP_CALAMITAS_DESCRIPTION": "投掷3枚产生不稳定黑洞的手雷。<style=cIsUtility>5</style>秒后，黑洞坍缩，造成<style=cIsDamage>700%伤害</style>。",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_KENKO_BANSHEE_UNLOCK_ACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "老娘是Mary Poppins，混蛋！",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_KENKO_BANSHEE_UNLOCK_ACHIEVEMENT_DESCRIPTION": "在不触地超过一次的情况下完成一个阶段。",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_KENKO_BANSHEE_MASTERYACHIEVEMENT_NAME": "Banshee：精通",
    "ACHIEVEMENT_KENKO_BANSHEE_MASTERYACHIEVEMENT_DESCRIPTION": "使用Banshee在Monsoon难度下通关游戏或抹除自身。",
    "<style=cKeywordName>Agile</style><style=cSub>The skill can be used while sprinting.</style>": "<style=cKeywordName>敏捷</style><style=cSub>该技能可在冲刺时使用。</style>",
    "<style=cKeywordName>Omen</style><style=cSub>This skill fires an <color=#ba8fff>Ethereal Wisp</color> when completed which deals <style=cIsDamage>200% damage</style> on hit and restores <style=cIsUtility>1</style> stock to your secondary skill.</style>": "<style=cKeywordName>预兆</style><style=cSub>该技能完成后会发射一团<color=#ba8fff>以太幽火</color>，命中时造成<style=cIsDamage>200%伤害</style>并为你的次要技能恢复<style=cIsUtility>1</style>次充能。</style>",
    "<style=cKeywordName>Aerodynamic</style><style=cSub>The skill deals more damage the longer the distance traveled before impact.</style>": "<style=cKeywordName>空气动力</style><style=cSub>撞击前移动的距离越长，该技能造成的伤害越高。</style>"
  }
}
